# Builds: user only

- Do **not** run `xcodebuild`, `swift build`, `swift test`, or other build/compile commands in this project unless the user explicitly asks for a one-off run in that turn.
- Do **not** run package resolution or dependency-fetch commands (`xcodebuild -resolvePackageDependencies`, etc.) to verify the project; the user handles Xcode/SPM locally.
- It is fine to **suggest** build steps or `xcodebuild` invocations as documentation when debugging, but default to: **you build in Xcode; the agent implements and stops short of building.**

If the user does ask you to run a build, you may do so in that case only.
